## 6.4 Standard Deviation
### Thinking About Quantifying Error in `MindsetMatters`
%%% test
ex() %>% {
check_object(., "empty_model") %>% check_equal()
check_output(., 556.7)
check_output(., 7.52)
check_output(., 2.74)
}
