- [$b_0$]{match="1"}
- [$b_1$]{match="4"}
- [$X_i$]{match="3"}
  :::
  ::: choices

  1. *b*
  2. *y*
  3. *x*
  4. *m*
  :::
  ::::::
  :::::::::

Fitting a regression model is a matter of finding the particular line (i.e., slope and intercept) that best fits the data (i.e., that minimizes the sum of squared errors).

